{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張振朗、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛和朱敏瀚在台慶夜大展身手，於「極速狂奔Speed and Stunt」環節中表現極亮眼。</p><p>尤其於綵排時曾於2米高地方摔下的朱敏瀚，在表演環節中，完美演繹由2米躍下的動作，動作相當利落，劉穎鏇亦打得十分精彩，技驚四座！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:15.178541+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:42:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:35.151248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:35.151248+00:00","content_hash":"e8e4b5c8f040a7cbab81f927b14fc3899235fe2b02519fbcd6958d2329ead7ed","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}